<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN V ZIMBABWE 2ND TEST 2ND DAY SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN V ZIMBABWE 2ND TEST 2ND DAY SCOREBOARD.</headline>
